{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p002553","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p002553"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p002553","label":"韓懿侯（魏世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"韓懿侯","mention_ids":["c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0037"]},{"surface":"懿侯","mention_ids":["c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0092"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0037","chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p029","quote":"韓懿侯"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0092","chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p029","quote":"懿侯"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"韓懿侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002553","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p029","chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"懿侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002553","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p029","chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji044-054","person_id":"cbr-p002553","surfaces":["懿侯","韓懿侯"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-044-wei"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p029","quote":"惠王元年，初，武侯卒也，子罃與公中緩爭爲太子。公孫頎自宋入趙，自趙入韓，謂韓懿侯曰：『魏罃與公中緩爭爲太子，君亦聞之乎？今魏罃得王錯，挾上黨，固半國也。因而除之，破魏必矣，不可失也。』懿侯説，乃與趙成侯合軍并兵以伐魏，戰于濁澤，魏氏大敗，魏君圍。趙謂韓曰：『除魏君，立公中緩，割地而退，我且利。』韓曰：『不可。殺魏君，人必曰暴；割地而退，人必曰貪。不如兩分之。魏分爲兩，不彊於宋、衞，則我終无魏之患矣。』趙不聽。韓不説，以其少卒夜去。惠王之所以身不死，國不分者，二家謀不和也。若從一家之謀，則魏必分矣。故曰『君終无適子，其國可破也』。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、是為及同段連續語境；外黃徐子／客按同一勸還對話暫接，龐涓／涓按同一馬陵戰暫接。孫子與孫臏、公子赫與襄王、齊王與齊宣王仍分候選；武下將識國別待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:p029","text":"惠王元年，初，武侯卒也，子罃與公中緩爭爲太子。公孫頎自宋入趙，自趙入韓，謂韓懿侯曰：『魏罃與公中緩爭爲太子，君亦聞之乎？今魏罃得王錯，挾上黨，固半國也。因而除之，破魏必矣，不可失也。』懿侯説，乃與趙成侯合軍并兵以伐魏，戰于濁澤，魏氏大敗，魏君圍。趙謂韓曰：『除魏君，立公中緩，割地而退，我且利。』韓曰：『不可。殺魏君，人必曰暴；割地而退，人必曰貪。不如兩分之。魏分爲兩，不彊於宋、衞，則我終无魏之患矣。』趙不聽。韓不説，以其少卒夜去。惠王之所以身不死，國不分者，二家謀不和也。若從一家之謀，則魏必分矣。故曰『君終无適子，其國可破也』。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002534","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"武侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002531","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"子罃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002534","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"公中緩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002551","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"太子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱與未定指代保留；公中緩爭太子不作已授太子，將識國別及孫子身份待核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"公孫頎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002552","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"韓懿侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002553","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"魏罃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002534","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"公中緩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002551","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"太子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱與未定指代保留；公中緩爭太子不作已授太子，將識國別及孫子身份待核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m029-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"魏罃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002534","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-we